WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.800 --> 03:10.960
I'd like Nuchwara and her son to stay here.

3
03:11.040 --> 03:13.560
You have to move in here with me.

4
03:13.640 --> 03:15.600
He may be the man you love.

5
03:15.680 --> 03:17.440
But you're not the woman he loves.

6
03:17.520 --> 03:19.080
PREVIOUSLY

7
03:19.160 --> 03:21.000
She's just Ramil's wife.

8
03:21.080 --> 03:23.120
What if I'm more than that?

9
03:24.600 --> 03:26.000
-Miss Chayanee! -Sweetheart.

10
03:26.080 --> 03:28.240
You're going to be a father.

11
03:36.440 --> 03:38.400
Chayanee, how are you feeling?

12
03:39.560 --> 03:41.080
Why are you asking?

13
03:42.320 --> 03:44.680
Were you hoping I had some terrible disease?

14
03:44.760 --> 03:46.280
Were you wishing I'd die?

15
03:47.320 --> 03:49.320
I only asked because I was worried about you.

16
03:49.400 --> 03:51.120
If you don't want to answer, that's fine.

17
03:53.480 --> 03:56.880
Forget it. Come on. Let's go to work.

18
03:59.840 --> 04:01.240
You're back.

19
04:01.880 --> 04:04.680
What is this? Why are you dressed in black and white?

20
04:04.760 --> 04:05.800
Whose funeral is it?

21
04:05.880 --> 04:09.520
I was thinking of taking my son to a funeral.

22
04:13.680 --> 04:15.920
Oh, you're still alive?

23
04:16.000 --> 04:19.040
That's enough. Are you wishing my daughter dead?

24
04:19.120 --> 04:21.160
You should slap her, Madam.

25
04:21.240 --> 04:22.079
Don't bother.

26
04:23.360 --> 04:25.280
If a dog barks at you,

27
04:25.360 --> 04:28.080
you don't bark back. Otherwise, you're no better than the dog.

28
04:33.880 --> 04:35.640
Come to think of it,

29
04:36.640 --> 04:38.440
wearing black and white

30
04:38.520 --> 04:40.080
is good practice for you.

31
04:40.680 --> 04:43.680
Before long, you'll probably be wearing it to your mother's funeral.

32
04:44.280 --> 04:45.720
Take your anger out on me.

33
04:47.600 --> 04:49.600
Don't involve my son.

34
04:50.320 --> 04:53.440
So this is what being a mother is like.

35
04:54.880 --> 04:58.560
Looks like I still have a lot to learn from you.

36
05:03.080 --> 05:04.640
Let's go.

37
05:04.720 --> 05:07.040
I want to tell Grandpa the good news.

38
05:07.600 --> 05:10.560
-Come on. Let's go see Grandpa. -What good news, Raiwin?

39
05:12.200 --> 05:13.680
Tell her.

40
05:14.720 --> 05:17.800
The good news is that we're having a baby together.

41
05:21.160 --> 05:23.600
A child born from our love.

42
05:25.240 --> 05:28.400
And an heir to this family.

43
05:34.120 --> 05:35.080
Come on.

44
05:40.200 --> 05:45.200
I'm so happy I'll get to help raise Miss Chayanee's baby.

45
05:45.280 --> 05:48.560
A child born into perfection.

46
05:48.640 --> 05:52.000
The mother owns a beautiful mansion,

47
05:52.080 --> 05:53.640
and the father is the Chief.

48
05:55.320 --> 05:58.000
What a perfect family.

49
06:12.480 --> 06:15.120
Papang, Daddy has to go to work now.

50
06:15.200 --> 06:16.880
I'll walk you out.

51
06:16.960 --> 06:18.160
Sure.

52
06:20.680 --> 06:21.640
Come on.

53
06:24.920 --> 06:28.640
You have to stay strong. Whatever you do, think about your son first.

54
06:43.320 --> 06:44.560
Who's calling?

55
06:45.560 --> 06:47.200
Someone from the Subdistrict Office.

56
06:47.280 --> 06:50.200
it's probably something urgent. I'll go take care of it. Give me a minute.

57
06:56.480 --> 06:57.920
Where's Raiwin going?

58
06:58.560 --> 07:02.080
He got a call. He said something urgent came up.

59
07:02.160 --> 07:05.520
Why does he have to walk so far away just to take a phone call?

60
07:06.680 --> 07:07.800
I'm only wondering.

61
07:09.760 --> 07:13.240
I'm not trying to make you suspicious, Miss Chayanee.

62
07:15.000 --> 07:17.480
Chayanee, I've been noticing something.

63
07:17.560 --> 07:22.560
Nuchwara and Raiwin act strangely whenever they see each other.

64
07:22.640 --> 07:25.040
And just now, when you said you were pregnant,

65
07:25.120 --> 07:29.000
Nuchwara looked furious. She couldn't stop staring at Raiwin.

66
07:29.520 --> 07:32.720
Exactly. She's Ramil's wife.

67
07:32.800 --> 07:35.640
Why would she be jealous of your man?

68
07:36.160 --> 07:39.360
I'm only… wondering.

69
07:39.440 --> 07:42.160
I'm not trying to make you suspicious.

70
07:51.240 --> 07:53.800
Wait, sweetheart. Put this away.

71
07:53.880 --> 07:55.200
Chayanee.

72
07:56.400 --> 07:59.160
Whenever she chases after her husband, I'm left doing all the work.

73
08:03.240 --> 08:07.160
Nuch, I'm begging you. Take Papang and go live somewhere else.

74
08:09.600 --> 08:12.120
You talk as if Papang isn't your son.

75
08:12.200 --> 08:14.600
Stop making this harder for me.

76
08:15.880 --> 08:19.040
How much money do you want? I'll find it for you.

77
08:19.720 --> 08:21.120
Just leave this place.

78
08:21.200 --> 08:23.840
You think you can throw money at me and make me disappear?

79
08:23.920 --> 08:25.840
Even back in college,

80
08:26.480 --> 08:29.320
you came after me just to cling to me for money.

81
08:30.800 --> 08:32.720
So don't pretend you loved me.

82
08:32.799 --> 08:36.720
I loved you. I wanted to spend my life with you.

83
08:39.799 --> 08:41.240
Where's your mother?

84
08:42.919 --> 08:46.480
I don't know. I just walked Daddy out.

85
08:46.560 --> 08:49.280
Papang. Have you seen Raiwin?

86
08:50.880 --> 08:54.000
Well? Have you seen your Uncle Raiwin?

87
08:54.080 --> 08:57.440
Answer me, or I'll smack you.

88
08:57.520 --> 08:59.480
Yes. He went that way.

89
09:04.120 --> 09:05.920
If those two are together,

90
09:06.000 --> 09:08.960
I'm telling you right now, they're hiding something.

91
09:11.000 --> 09:12.440
Where's Raiwin?

92
09:13.560 --> 09:14.600
She isn't here either.

93
09:14.680 --> 09:18.240
Madam. Miss Chayanee. That little brat tricked us.

94
09:21.680 --> 09:22.600
You…

95
09:25.480 --> 09:27.680
I once loved you with all my heart.

96
09:28.840 --> 09:30.160
It wasn't until I got pregnant

97
09:31.160 --> 09:33.160
that I saw who you really were.

98
09:33.240 --> 09:36.000
Selfish. Irresponsible.

99
09:36.080 --> 09:38.280
Then why are you still here?

100
09:39.520 --> 09:40.680
Because of Ramil.

101
09:42.560 --> 09:45.440
He may not be Papang's biological father,

102
09:47.120 --> 09:48.960
but he loves my son.

103
09:49.560 --> 09:52.960
Ramil has Hathaya now.

104
09:54.080 --> 09:57.600
He's never going to love you. Understand? Stop this nonsense

105
09:58.360 --> 09:59.200
and go home.

106
09:59.280 --> 10:01.600
I don't need you telling me how to live my life.

107
10:01.680 --> 10:03.720
I can handle myself.

108
10:06.720 --> 10:08.800
I didn't even want to stay here.

109
10:09.480 --> 10:12.120
And I don't want to keep seeing a terrible man like you.

110
10:14.480 --> 10:17.840
But now that I know Chayanee is pregnant,

111
10:18.800 --> 10:20.480
I've changed my mind.

112
10:23.320 --> 10:25.120
I'm staying right here

113
10:26.600 --> 10:29.720
to ruin the happiness you two think you have.

114
10:33.000 --> 10:36.000
And if she finds out Papang is your son,

115
10:38.120 --> 10:39.680
she'll lose her mind.

116
10:42.320 --> 10:43.280
Don't.

117
10:45.120 --> 10:48.680
What do I have to do to make you leave?

118
10:50.200 --> 10:51.880
The day I was pregnant

119
10:54.200 --> 10:55.920
and you abandoned me

120
10:58.720 --> 11:01.640
was the most painful day of my life.

121
11:04.000 --> 11:06.240
You'll live with the consequences of what you did.

122
11:07.960 --> 11:10.040
And remember this.

123
11:11.280 --> 11:13.640
If you throw my son and me out,

124
11:15.720 --> 11:18.520
or if you hurt my son,

125
11:20.840 --> 11:22.560
I'll expose everything immediately.

126
11:43.120 --> 11:45.520
Hello. I just finished dealing with work.

127
11:46.320 --> 11:49.600
I'll meet you in Grandpa's room. That's all.

128
11:55.640 --> 11:58.440
Your girlfriend was looking for you.

129
11:59.920 --> 12:02.360
She looked as angry as a giant.

130
12:02.440 --> 12:06.360
I thought she was going to yell at you,

131
12:07.160 --> 12:10.920
so I sent her the wrong way.

132
12:13.760 --> 12:15.680
I'm sorry

133
12:15.760 --> 12:18.960
I lied. That was naughty.

134
12:21.240 --> 12:24.000
I know you're upset.

135
12:24.920 --> 12:27.000
Do you want to play games with me?

136
12:27.080 --> 12:30.800
I have lots of fun games.

137
12:32.360 --> 12:34.760
-That many? -Yes.

138
12:35.280 --> 12:36.920
Thank you.

139
12:39.880 --> 12:43.160
Papang. I'm okay now.

140
12:45.840 --> 12:47.000
You're a sweet kid.

141
13:02.760 --> 13:06.120
This collection is absolutely gorgeous.

142
13:07.640 --> 13:09.600
That's a lot of shopping, Madam.

143
13:10.320 --> 13:11.440
Pong.

144
13:12.240 --> 13:14.720
Next time you buy this much,

145
13:14.800 --> 13:16.880
let me come carry everything for you.

146
13:19.040 --> 13:21.760
Don't be so distant.

147
13:21.840 --> 13:23.320
I've missed you terribly.

148
13:23.400 --> 13:24.640
Let go.

149
13:33.440 --> 13:34.560
What do you want?

150
13:35.160 --> 13:36.520
I missed you.

151
13:37.040 --> 13:38.840
And I missed your money.

152
13:41.520 --> 13:44.320
You already took money from me last time. What more do you want?

153
13:44.960 --> 13:48.080
Come on, Madam. Everything is expensive.

154
13:48.160 --> 13:51.520
I still have to eat and live.

155
13:51.600 --> 13:53.240
I don't have any more money for you.

156
13:54.240 --> 13:56.360
Fine. If you don't have it,

157
13:56.920 --> 13:58.800
I'll ask your father-in-law.

158
13:58.880 --> 14:00.240
He's bedridden at home now, huh?

159
14:01.000 --> 14:02.800
Don't. Leave him alone.

160
14:03.600 --> 14:04.600
Fine.

161
14:05.200 --> 14:07.680
You control the accounts at the office, don't you?

162
14:08.400 --> 14:10.320
You're crafty enough to skim some money.

163
14:11.280 --> 14:12.760
Bring me some.

164
14:16.600 --> 14:18.280
Give me some time.

165
14:18.880 --> 14:20.400
I'll find the money.

166
14:21.120 --> 14:24.200
But don't show up at my office or my house.

167
14:24.840 --> 14:27.800
Of course. That's no problem.

168
14:30.200 --> 14:31.400
Give me.

169
14:33.800 --> 14:36.080
-Pong! -Let go.

170
14:38.720 --> 14:42.280
I'll take these for now. I can probably sell them for tens of thousands.

171
14:43.120 --> 14:45.000
Consider it a deposit.

172
14:45.080 --> 14:47.680
If you want to make a profit,

173
14:48.760 --> 14:49.760
message me.

174
14:50.840 --> 14:51.880
Later.

175
15:00.600 --> 15:02.640
I never should have gotten involved with you.

176
15:03.200 --> 15:05.040
What terrible karma.

177
15:07.120 --> 15:08.600
Miss Chayanee.

178
15:08.680 --> 15:11.600
-Is Raiwin back? -Yes.

179
15:12.200 --> 15:14.760
Where is he? He'd better not be sneaking off again.

180
15:16.000 --> 15:19.760
No. Since he got back, he's been in the bedroom.

181
15:19.840 --> 15:21.200
He hasn't spoken to anyone.

182
15:22.800 --> 15:24.160
And Nuchwara and her son?

183
15:25.280 --> 15:27.560
Probably in their room. Miss Chayanee.

184
15:27.640 --> 15:30.960
Don't waste your energy on those parasites.

185
15:31.920 --> 15:34.960
Let me take these to your bedroom.

186
15:35.560 --> 15:36.560
No.

187
15:37.080 --> 15:39.480
I want some time alone with him and our baby.

188
15:39.560 --> 15:43.120
Speaking of the baby, I'm so excited.

189
15:43.200 --> 15:46.240
I wish you could give birth tomorrow.

190
15:46.320 --> 15:48.640
I can't wait to look after a baby again.

191
15:48.720 --> 15:52.080
Do you remember when you were little?

192
15:52.160 --> 15:55.840
I used to sing you lullabies. I've been practicing already.

193
15:55.920 --> 15:57.320
Listen.

194
15:57.960 --> 16:00.400
Little cuckoo bird

195
16:02.200 --> 16:05.920
You left your egg for Mother Crow to hatch

196
16:06.000 --> 16:08.520
Mother Crow grew to love it

197
16:08.600 --> 16:09.920
Thinking it was her own…

198
16:10.000 --> 16:10.840
Miss Chayanee.

199
16:21.160 --> 16:22.360
You're back?

200
16:32.880 --> 16:35.080
How did you get in here?

201
16:35.160 --> 16:36.400
Well.

202
16:37.040 --> 16:40.560
Since I'm staying in this house, I thought I should help with the chores.

203
16:43.360 --> 16:45.600
What a shame you already finished showering.

204
16:45.680 --> 16:47.720
I was going to scrub your back for you.

205
16:47.800 --> 16:51.560
But I could still powder you instead.

206
16:53.360 --> 16:54.560
No.

207
16:54.640 --> 16:56.440
I want to help.

208
16:57.040 --> 16:59.040
Get out. Chayanee could see you.

209
17:01.000 --> 17:02.120
Go.

210
17:02.720 --> 17:03.800
You.

211
17:08.119 --> 17:09.200
Hello.

212
17:10.359 --> 17:12.319
What are you doing in my room?

213
17:15.319 --> 17:16.800
What are you two doing?

214
17:22.720 --> 17:23.880
It's just that…

215
17:24.640 --> 17:26.920
I was going to clean Mr. Pichai's room,

216
17:27.000 --> 17:30.320
but I walked into the wrong one. Sorry to disturb you.

217
17:31.440 --> 17:32.720
Then get out.

218
17:36.880 --> 17:39.840
Come to think of it, this room is pretty filthy.

219
17:39.920 --> 17:42.240
There's dirt everywhere.

220
17:42.320 --> 17:45.640
I'll help scrub all the filth out.

221
17:46.280 --> 17:48.400
No. Get out.

222
17:51.320 --> 17:52.560
I said get out.

223
17:58.800 --> 18:02.160
Do you see what she's doing? She's deliberately trying to provoke me.

224
18:03.160 --> 18:04.960
You have to throw her and her son out.

225
18:08.200 --> 18:09.400
Let me handle this.

226
18:20.320 --> 18:22.920
You want me to take Nuchwara and Papang somewhere else?

227
18:23.000 --> 18:26.520
Yes. I'll support my family financially myself.

228
18:27.760 --> 18:30.480
That's the first time I've ever heard you call them family.

229
18:31.480 --> 18:34.840
But if you finally accept Nuchwara and Papang as your family,

230
18:35.520 --> 18:36.800
you should tell everyone.

231
18:37.400 --> 18:40.280
I'm begging you. Don't bring that up again.

232
18:40.360 --> 18:42.480
Nuchwara threatened to expose everything.

233
18:42.560 --> 18:44.840
Chayanee is demanding that I get rid of her.

234
18:46.960 --> 18:48.360
Please, Ramil.

235
18:49.240 --> 18:50.840
You're the only one who can help me.

236
18:51.440 --> 18:53.280
You choose to protect Chayanee.

237
18:54.080 --> 18:56.360
What about protecting Nuchwara and Papang?

238
18:57.600 --> 18:58.800
I don't have a choice.

239
18:59.440 --> 19:02.760
You do have a choice. You already made it.

240
19:03.920 --> 19:05.280
You chose to protect yourself.

241
19:05.880 --> 19:08.600
Ramil, please.

242
19:09.160 --> 19:10.440
Help me.

243
19:11.280 --> 19:13.360
If Chayanee finds out the truth,

244
19:14.080 --> 19:15.880
my life is over.

245
19:18.120 --> 19:19.040
Fine.

246
19:20.600 --> 19:21.720
I'll try.

247
19:22.480 --> 19:24.040
But you'd better prepare yourself.

248
19:24.800 --> 19:28.640
Whatever you've done, you're going to face the consequences.

249
19:41.920 --> 19:43.000
Madam.

250
19:43.080 --> 19:45.400
Does Pong call you this much all the time?

251
19:45.480 --> 19:47.240
Just hang up on him.

252
19:48.600 --> 19:52.040
He keeps hounding me for money.

253
19:52.120 --> 19:54.200
You shouldn't have gotten involved with him.

254
19:54.280 --> 19:56.080
You know what they say.

255
19:56.160 --> 19:58.560
Play with a dog and it'll lick your mouth.

256
19:58.640 --> 20:01.160
Chamoi, I don't need a lecture.

257
20:01.240 --> 20:03.520
Help me think. What am I supposed to do?

258
20:04.760 --> 20:08.800
He'll keep blackmailing me for money until the day I die.

259
20:09.840 --> 20:12.320
If you don't want to die, kill him.

260
20:12.400 --> 20:14.240
Kill him.

261
20:16.200 --> 20:17.560
Kill him?

262
20:18.080 --> 20:22.480
Madam, I was joking. Madam.

263
20:22.560 --> 20:26.400
You've already committed enough terrible sins.

264
20:26.480 --> 20:28.520
Please don't do anything else.

265
20:30.680 --> 20:32.240
Madam.

266
20:33.440 --> 20:34.720
Pong.

267
20:37.600 --> 20:38.800
Come on…

268
20:45.280 --> 20:47.320
If you don't come out, I'm coming in.

269
20:47.400 --> 20:48.480
Don't.

270
20:49.160 --> 20:51.240
I'll come out to you.

271
20:53.800 --> 20:56.680
Chamoi, keep watch.

272
20:56.760 --> 20:58.480
Don't let anyone go near the gate.

273
21:04.680 --> 21:05.560
Aunt Chamoi.

274
21:09.080 --> 21:11.480
-What do you want? -What are you doing?

275
21:13.880 --> 21:17.320
-I'm looking at the moon. -Oh, but…

276
21:18.000 --> 21:20.400
I just saw you peeking at someone.

277
21:20.480 --> 21:22.880
Hey. Listen.

278
21:22.960 --> 21:26.360
Whatever it is you're doing, go do it. Stop bothering me.

279
21:27.520 --> 21:28.360
Go.

280
21:37.840 --> 21:39.960
I told you not to come here.

281
21:40.040 --> 21:43.280
You wouldn't answer my calls. So I had to come here.

282
21:43.360 --> 21:46.520
I already asked you to give me some time.

283
21:46.600 --> 21:48.840
I can't just produce the money instantly.

284
21:48.920 --> 21:49.920
I want my money.

285
21:51.120 --> 21:52.960
If I don't get it, prepare your coffin.

286
21:53.920 --> 21:55.800
Go.

287
21:55.880 --> 21:58.080
I'll take care of it. Go.

288
22:04.320 --> 22:05.680
Madam.

289
22:08.880 --> 22:09.760
What?

290
22:14.320 --> 22:15.640
Aunt Liu, who were you talking to?

291
22:16.560 --> 22:18.840
Talking to? No one.

292
22:19.440 --> 22:20.840
I was just out for a walk.

293
22:21.440 --> 22:25.240
But I thought I saw you talking to someone.

294
22:28.120 --> 22:30.760
You can clearly see I'm alone.

295
22:31.760 --> 22:33.800
Get your eyes checked. You're delusional.

296
22:40.760 --> 22:43.120
Look at this. So beautiful.

297
22:48.480 --> 22:49.400
Madam.

298
22:50.000 --> 22:52.880
That was lucky. Hathaya didn't see

299
22:52.960 --> 22:55.120
you talking to Pong.

300
23:01.120 --> 23:04.320
I thought you were going to cut roses for Grandpa's vase.

301
23:04.400 --> 23:05.240
Where were you?

302
23:05.320 --> 23:08.400
I saw Aunt Liu secretly talking to a man by the gate.

303
23:09.880 --> 23:10.920
Who?

304
23:14.400 --> 23:16.680
-Pong. -What? Pong?

305
23:18.000 --> 23:20.120
Pong came back to see Liu?

306
23:20.200 --> 23:23.760
Then those two must be working together on something terrible.

307
23:26.200 --> 23:27.360
What should we do?

308
23:27.440 --> 23:29.360
We have to catch them red-handed.

309
23:34.360 --> 23:37.360
Aunt Liu just withdrew money. Where is she going?

310
23:40.000 --> 23:41.920
We're finally going to find out the truth.

311
23:49.360 --> 23:53.560
I'll bring you the money tomorrow. I'll send you the location.

312
24:15.080 --> 24:16.440
That's Ramil's car.

313
24:55.880 --> 24:58.640
Liu realized we were following her. She deliberately lost us.

314
24:59.840 --> 25:02.200
She must be up to something bad.

315
25:03.480 --> 25:05.280
Should we turn back?

316
25:06.920 --> 25:08.400
I think we should keep going.

317
25:24.280 --> 25:25.720
Do you know how long I waited?

318
25:25.800 --> 25:28.520
If you were any later,

319
25:28.600 --> 25:29.680
I'd have gone to you.

320
25:32.560 --> 25:33.840
Here.

321
25:45.520 --> 25:49.320
You're the sweetest, Madam. See you.

322
25:50.080 --> 25:51.200
Wait.

323
25:54.200 --> 25:55.600
Why are you in such a hurry?

324
25:55.680 --> 25:57.800
I want to spend more time with you.

325
25:58.520 --> 26:00.000
Stay with me for a while.

326
26:09.240 --> 26:10.920
What's gotten into you?

327
26:11.000 --> 26:12.880
Drinking with me this early?

328
26:12.960 --> 26:14.320
I'm angry.

329
26:14.840 --> 26:17.000
I had to give you all this money

330
26:17.080 --> 26:20.160
-instead of spending it on shopping. -Madam.

331
26:21.240 --> 26:23.480
Why be angry at me?

332
26:24.240 --> 26:26.840
Think of it as sharing. You have plenty.

333
26:27.680 --> 26:32.480
And don't forget there was a time I made you very happy.

334
26:33.280 --> 26:34.720
Listen. To make you feel better,

335
26:34.800 --> 26:37.880
consider it payment for a young escort.

336
26:38.480 --> 26:40.760
You're one very expensive escort.

337
26:42.600 --> 26:45.440
So do your job

338
26:45.520 --> 26:47.080
and take good care of me.

339
26:57.280 --> 26:58.520
Refreshing.

340
27:04.240 --> 27:06.320
I've always been good to you.

341
27:07.720 --> 27:09.640
Show me some gratitude.

342
27:11.120 --> 27:12.320
Finish it.

343
27:24.960 --> 27:28.280
Ramil, whose car is that? That isn't Aunt Liu's car.

344
27:29.040 --> 27:31.480
You're right. Who would come all the way out here?

345
27:34.600 --> 27:36.160
Sweet.

346
27:36.240 --> 27:39.240
That's my good boy.

347
27:41.760 --> 27:44.520
Madam, do you know

348
27:45.560 --> 27:46.880
that I…

349
27:47.680 --> 27:49.560
never had any feelings for you?

350
27:50.280 --> 27:52.200
Everything I did

351
27:53.400 --> 27:55.360
was because I wanted your money.

352
28:03.520 --> 28:05.360
You never loved me?

353
28:07.280 --> 28:09.200
Come on. You really shouldn't ask.

354
28:09.280 --> 28:12.600
Honestly, look at yourself.

355
28:14.720 --> 28:16.000
Who would love you?

356
28:16.080 --> 28:19.320
Anyone who comes near you only wants your money.

357
28:19.400 --> 28:22.440
Your face is already shriveling up.

358
28:22.520 --> 28:24.560
Even a ghost would run away from you.

359
28:26.760 --> 28:27.760
God.

360
28:29.080 --> 28:30.320
Then go to hell.

361
28:31.840 --> 28:33.720
That's so sweet.

362
28:36.680 --> 28:39.400
Madam, I have to go.

363
28:41.000 --> 28:41.880
But let me warn you.

364
28:42.480 --> 28:46.320
This money won't last long.

365
28:46.400 --> 28:49.840
So your job is to find more.

366
28:49.920 --> 28:53.440
If I don't get another payment, you know what I'll do.

367
28:53.520 --> 28:55.960
You know what'll happen.

368
28:56.040 --> 28:57.040
Hey.

369
28:58.400 --> 28:59.480
Watch this before I go?

370
29:12.000 --> 29:15.840
Madam… What did you put in that drink?

371
29:19.320 --> 29:22.120
Something good to send you straight to hell.

372
29:30.600 --> 29:32.120
If I'm going to hell,

373
29:32.200 --> 29:34.240
you're coming with me.

374
29:47.600 --> 29:48.960
Madam.

375
29:55.720 --> 29:59.520
I'm not letting a parasite like you suck me dry.

376
29:59.600 --> 30:01.320
A rotten man like you deserves to die.

377
30:19.720 --> 30:21.480
The gunshot came from this direction.

378
30:24.880 --> 30:28.040
Ramil! Hey! Hey!

379
30:38.240 --> 30:40.280
-Pong. -Pong.

380
30:47.320 --> 30:49.120
It looks like he was poisoned.

381
30:49.200 --> 30:51.280
I hope the doctors can save him.

382
30:51.360 --> 30:55.280
I want to know what happened, and whether Aunt Liu had anything to do with it.

383
30:56.320 --> 30:59.560
I'm sure Liu knows something about this.

384
31:00.640 --> 31:01.880
Hathaya.

385
31:01.960 --> 31:03.960
You have to keep this secret.

386
31:04.560 --> 31:07.400
Liu cannot find out that Pong is being treated here.

387
31:09.120 --> 31:10.240
I'll notify the police.

388
31:10.320 --> 31:14.520
Once Pong recovers, he'll have to give a statement.

389
31:16.640 --> 31:19.280
Mom, where have you been?

390
31:19.360 --> 31:21.280
You're usually never home this late.

391
31:22.120 --> 31:25.240
I stopped to make a donation for funeral coffins.

392
31:26.400 --> 31:27.640
Madam.

393
31:27.720 --> 31:30.280
You hardly ever make merit.

394
31:30.360 --> 31:33.080
What wandering spirit came to you in a dream today?

395
31:36.840 --> 31:39.680
Chamoi, have you heard any news today?

396
31:40.960 --> 31:42.480
Just the usual.

397
31:42.560 --> 31:45.640
Politics. People switching sides and changing alliances.

398
31:46.480 --> 31:48.760
I mean crime news.

399
31:49.840 --> 31:53.480
A drugged-out son attacked his father, murdered his mother, and committed rape.

400
31:53.560 --> 31:57.640
And there was some road-rage shooting too.

401
31:58.160 --> 32:01.640
Was there anything about someone dying from poison?

402
32:03.040 --> 32:04.400
Why are you asking, Mom?

403
32:05.000 --> 32:08.720
You never care about that kind of news.

404
32:09.280 --> 32:12.320
I want to know whether Pong is dead yet.

405
32:12.400 --> 32:14.000
What are you talking about?

406
32:23.200 --> 32:26.120
Pong was blackmailing me.

407
32:26.680 --> 32:28.840
He extorted millions from me.

408
32:29.600 --> 32:32.600
Then he threatened to kill me.

409
32:33.720 --> 32:36.640
So I poisoned him.

410
32:46.040 --> 32:50.560
I haven't heard anything. Maybe no one has found his body yet.

411
32:53.520 --> 32:56.640
I'm scared. I don't want to go to prison.

412
32:56.720 --> 32:58.320
I'm scared.

413
33:00.360 --> 33:02.040
I'll help you, Mom.

414
33:03.120 --> 33:05.400
We'll help you.

415
33:07.120 --> 33:08.320
You keep your mouth shut.

416
33:08.920 --> 33:10.720
Otherwise, you'll end up dead just like him.

417
33:13.000 --> 33:15.600
I won't say anything.

418
33:16.200 --> 33:17.880
Keep watching the news about Pong.

419
33:17.960 --> 33:20.560
If you hear anything, tell me immediately.

420
33:21.160 --> 33:22.200
Yes.

421
33:23.600 --> 33:26.480
Calm down, Mom.

422
33:27.040 --> 33:28.640
Go get some rest.

423
33:40.040 --> 33:41.440
It's okay, Mom.

424
33:52.680 --> 33:54.920
You asked to speak to me privately.

425
33:55.000 --> 33:57.080
It must be important.

426
33:59.160 --> 34:00.480
I want you to go back home.

427
34:02.600 --> 34:04.040
Papang can stay here.

428
34:04.840 --> 34:06.840
I'll take the best possible care of him.

429
34:09.600 --> 34:11.760
Raiwin really hasn't changed. Still selfish.

430
34:12.920 --> 34:14.880
Still incapable of solving his own problems.

431
34:16.120 --> 34:18.960
And you're such a good younger brother.

432
34:19.040 --> 34:20.880
Always cleaning up after him.

433
34:22.480 --> 34:24.159
I'm not asking you this

434
34:25.320 --> 34:28.960
because of Raiwin. I'm asking because I love Papang.

435
34:29.800 --> 34:32.120
I want him to have a better life.

436
34:34.040 --> 34:36.560
Then what are you offering?

437
34:37.600 --> 34:39.120
If it's good enough, I'll leave.

438
34:39.719 --> 34:42.880
Raiwin will cover all your expenses and Papang's.

439
34:47.480 --> 34:48.520
Good.

440
34:49.639 --> 34:52.080
Then I won't have to worry about money for my son.

441
34:53.120 --> 34:55.520
So you accept?

442
34:56.239 --> 34:58.080
I'll accept,

443
34:58.920 --> 35:01.160
if you accept my offer.

444
35:02.360 --> 35:03.400
What offer?

445
35:04.240 --> 35:06.400
I know you don't love me right now.

446
35:07.320 --> 35:10.360
But I want to show you that I truly want to build a life with you.

447
35:11.560 --> 35:12.920
You love Papang.

448
35:13.960 --> 35:16.000
I want us to be a family.

449
35:20.960 --> 35:24.960
That's all I'm asking. Can you give me that?

450
35:32.360 --> 35:34.560
I've spent enough of my life helping others.

451
35:35.520 --> 35:37.000
From now on,

452
35:38.840 --> 35:40.480
I won't deny my feelings anymore.

453
35:42.040 --> 35:44.400
You're rejecting me? Don't you care

454
35:46.440 --> 35:48.440
that I could expose Raiwin?

455
35:52.680 --> 35:54.480
If you don't care about how Papang will feel

456
35:55.560 --> 35:56.680
and want to expose Raiwin

457
35:57.200 --> 35:59.480
and destroy him and Chayanee,

458
36:00.400 --> 36:01.720
that's your decision.

459
36:04.840 --> 36:07.240
The reason I haven't said anything is because I do care.

460
36:09.080 --> 36:10.560
I care about my son.

461
36:11.840 --> 36:13.720
Everything I do is for him.

462
36:18.200 --> 36:21.440
But if people keep pushing me until I can't take it anymore,

463
36:22.880 --> 36:24.320
I won't stay quiet.

464
36:38.200 --> 36:40.160
Have you seen Papang?

465
36:42.360 --> 36:45.720
He's upstairs reading to Mr. Pichai.

466
36:48.080 --> 36:50.400
I was thinking of taking him out somewhere.

467
36:53.040 --> 36:53.880
Wait.

468
36:54.640 --> 36:58.240
Don't you want to know what Nuchwara and I talked about?

469
36:59.920 --> 37:03.080
That's your private business. Why would I need to know?

470
37:05.560 --> 37:06.880
Because I want to tell you.

471
37:08.200 --> 37:10.160
You don't have to.

472
37:10.240 --> 37:13.480
I'm a woman too. I already know what Nuchwara wants.

473
37:16.160 --> 37:19.040
Then do you know my answer?

474
37:28.560 --> 37:30.120
From now on…

475
37:34.040 --> 37:36.680
I'm not going to deny my own feelings anymore.

476
37:41.560 --> 37:43.120
I'll protect you.

477
37:53.840 --> 37:56.720
I… I'm taking Papang out.

478
37:58.480 --> 38:01.240
I'm coming too. Let's hang out.

479
38:05.160 --> 38:08.600
Miss Chayanee, I had the table set already.

480
38:10.000 --> 38:10.920
Where's Raiwin?

481
38:11.000 --> 38:13.720
He's waiting downstairs at the dining table.

482
38:14.720 --> 38:18.120
What's wrong with him? He should've waited for me so we could go down together.

483
38:18.200 --> 38:20.560
Don't overthink it.

484
38:20.640 --> 38:23.240
Mr. Raiwin is probably in a hurry to get to work.

485
38:23.320 --> 38:25.760
Even in a rush, he should take care of his wife.

486
38:25.840 --> 38:27.320
I'm carrying his baby.

487
38:27.400 --> 38:30.360
Miss Chayanee, don't get stressed.

488
38:30.440 --> 38:34.240
Stress affects the baby. Breathe in. Breathe out.

489
38:34.320 --> 38:37.200
And be careful when you walk.

490
38:37.280 --> 38:40.400
You have two lives to look after now.

491
38:46.760 --> 38:49.440
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

492
38:49.520 --> 38:51.800
Where are you going? Go on.

493
38:51.880 --> 38:53.200
INTERNATIONAL FOLKTALES

494
38:54.280 --> 38:57.320
Last time he tricked me because he wanted to help his mother.

495
38:58.000 --> 38:59.640
He expects me to believe this wasn't intentional?

496
39:01.120 --> 39:04.680
You did that on purpose. You were trying to make me lose my baby.

497
39:09.560 --> 39:10.920
Chayanee.

498
39:11.000 --> 39:12.000
Don't!

499
39:13.680 --> 39:15.000
Ramil!

500
39:17.560 --> 39:20.880
Miss Chayanee. Do you realize what you just did?

501
39:20.960 --> 39:23.080
If he'd fallen, he could've died.

502
39:23.680 --> 39:25.400
That's exactly what I wanted.

503
39:26.600 --> 39:29.400
Miss Chayanee, they're going to come after you for this.

504
39:29.480 --> 39:31.000
What happened?

505
39:33.240 --> 39:35.840
If you want to know, ask your girlfriend.

506
39:36.640 --> 39:39.480
Chayanee, what happened?

507
39:40.080 --> 39:41.800
I didn't do anything to that kid.

508
39:42.760 --> 39:44.880
He got scared and started screaming on his own.

509
39:44.960 --> 39:46.760
Chayanee.

510
39:46.840 --> 39:48.600
Ramil and I both saw you

511
39:48.680 --> 39:50.600
push Papang down the stairs.

512
39:50.680 --> 39:52.680
Ramil caught him just in time.

513
39:52.760 --> 39:56.000
I didn't push him. Don't accuse me of something I didn't do.

514
39:56.080 --> 39:59.560
You're lying right to our faces. I saw you.

515
39:59.640 --> 40:01.840
You're trying to frame me.

516
40:02.800 --> 40:04.520
If you don't believe me, ask Aunt Chamoi.

517
40:05.480 --> 40:08.240
Miss Chayanee didn't do anything. She didn't push Papang.

518
40:08.320 --> 40:11.200
Aunt Chamoi, you don't have to be afraid of anyone.

519
40:12.160 --> 40:13.680
You need to tell the truth.

520
40:13.760 --> 40:16.680
If you lie, you'll be responsible too.

521
40:17.600 --> 40:19.880
Don't threaten my maid.

522
40:21.400 --> 40:22.880
She didn't push that boy.

523
40:24.800 --> 40:28.240
If you want the truth, ask Papang.

524
40:29.440 --> 40:31.480
Papang, tell him.

525
40:34.160 --> 40:35.320
Tell him what happened.

526
40:40.880 --> 40:42.120
Papang.

527
40:42.920 --> 40:44.680
Okay. Enough.

528
40:46.080 --> 40:48.920
Papang is safe. That's what matters. Let's end this here.

529
40:50.000 --> 40:51.400
I'm not letting this go.

530
40:53.360 --> 40:55.560
Anyone who hurts my son

531
40:56.520 --> 40:57.880
is going to answer for it.

532
40:57.960 --> 40:59.120
Hey.

533
40:59.920 --> 41:02.080
What is all this shouting?

534
41:02.160 --> 41:03.920
Why are you making such a scene?

535
41:05.280 --> 41:06.440
Papang.

536
41:07.440 --> 41:08.800
What happened?

537
41:08.880 --> 41:12.440
I came out of Great-Grandpa's room.

538
41:13.040 --> 41:16.920
I wasn't looking and accidentally bumped into Aunt Chayanee.

539
41:17.000 --> 41:19.880
She was okay.

540
41:20.560 --> 41:22.840
Then I started walking downstairs,

541
41:24.920 --> 41:28.520
and she pushed me.

542
41:31.600 --> 41:33.280
You tried to hurt my son?

543
41:33.360 --> 41:34.320
Yes.

544
41:34.400 --> 41:36.800
I wanted to push him down the stairs and kill him.

545
41:36.880 --> 41:40.240
I already told you. If you have a problem,

546
41:40.320 --> 41:42.160
take it out on me.

547
41:42.240 --> 41:43.760
Don't hurt my son.

548
41:43.840 --> 41:45.560
Don't act innocent.

549
41:45.640 --> 41:48.240
You told your son to knock me down the stairs,

550
41:48.320 --> 41:49.880
so I'd die along with my baby.

551
41:49.960 --> 41:53.120
I have never taught my son to do anything that evil.

552
41:54.080 --> 41:55.840
But frankly,

553
41:55.920 --> 41:58.520
if you and your baby both died, that would be great.

554
41:59.960 --> 42:01.120
You parasite!

555
42:05.640 --> 42:07.760
You tried to hurt my son,

556
42:09.440 --> 42:11.640
and now you have the nerve to hit me too?

557
42:12.960 --> 42:14.360
You evil bitch!

558
42:14.440 --> 42:16.520
Chamoi, go help my daughter.

559
42:16.600 --> 42:18.400
Stop!

560
42:18.480 --> 42:19.840
-Stop. -Stop right now.

561
42:19.920 --> 42:21.600
-Chayanee. Enough. -Help her!

562
42:21.680 --> 42:24.800
Stop. Ramil, take Nuchwara away.

563
42:25.600 --> 42:29.640
Let go. I warned you, didn't I?

564
42:31.920 --> 42:34.200
You dare throw me out?

565
42:36.920 --> 42:39.240
No one was hurt. Hey.

566
42:39.760 --> 42:42.200
Enough. Please.

567
42:42.280 --> 42:44.760
Let this end here. I'll take you out.

568
42:44.840 --> 42:46.720
I'm not going anywhere.

569
42:48.240 --> 42:51.640
I already told you to throw them out of this house.

570
42:51.720 --> 42:53.160
Why won't you do it?

571
42:55.200 --> 42:56.440
Go ahead.

572
42:56.520 --> 42:59.200
Your girlfriend wants you to throw my son and me out.

573
43:00.440 --> 43:01.280
Say it.

574
43:03.280 --> 43:05.560
Tell me to leave

575
43:07.800 --> 43:09.520
and I'll go.

576
43:12.720 --> 43:15.360
Why are you standing there like an idiot? Throw her out.

577
43:16.760 --> 43:18.320
Say it.

578
43:20.440 --> 43:23.480
I think your boyfriend is more afraid of me than he is of you.

579
43:25.640 --> 43:26.760
Throw her out.

580
43:28.520 --> 43:29.800
I said throw her out.

581
43:29.880 --> 43:32.240
What is wrong with you? Throw her out!

582
43:32.320 --> 43:33.760
Nuchwara threatened me.

583
43:35.640 --> 43:37.840
Papang, come with Daddy.

584
43:38.680 --> 43:40.720
No. Papang, stay with Mommy.

585
43:43.960 --> 43:45.640
I'm not going anywhere.

586
43:46.760 --> 43:49.600
Anyone who dares hurt my son

587
43:50.320 --> 43:51.480
is going to deal with me.

588
43:53.360 --> 43:54.280
Don't, Nuch.

589
43:57.360 --> 43:59.680
Raiwin doesn't dare throw me out of this house

590
44:03.200 --> 44:04.520
because…

591
44:08.240 --> 44:10.840
I was Raiwin's first wife.

592
44:17.680 --> 44:21.680
And Papang is his first child.

593
44:25.520 --> 44:26.960
And you

594
44:28.000 --> 44:30.880
are nothing more than the woman who came after me.

595
44:34.920 --> 44:36.000
Tell me that isn't true.

596
44:39.960 --> 44:43.200
Everything this parasite just said is a lie, right?

597
44:47.400 --> 44:48.840
Say something!

598
44:50.720 --> 44:54.120
Go on. Tell her.

599
44:55.240 --> 44:57.160
Tell her that when I was pregnant,

600
44:58.920 --> 45:00.720
you made Ramil take responsibility.

601
45:05.320 --> 45:07.320
You're nothing but a selfish coward.

602
45:13.080 --> 45:14.240
-Papang. -Papang.

603
45:14.320 --> 45:16.640
-Papang. -Papang.

604
45:19.200 --> 45:20.720
And you should be careful.

605
45:21.480 --> 45:23.680
That baby you're carrying

606
45:23.760 --> 45:25.960
wasn't conceived out of love.

607
45:27.520 --> 45:29.360
Because this man

608
45:30.040 --> 45:31.920
only cares about what he can gain.

609
45:38.440 --> 45:40.720
It isn't true, is it?

610
45:40.800 --> 45:42.080
Madam…

611
45:42.160 --> 45:44.720
It isn't true. Say something.

612
45:46.320 --> 45:48.560
Why didn't you ever tell me?

613
45:48.640 --> 45:50.040
Why? Why?

614
45:50.120 --> 45:51.640
Why?

615
45:54.040 --> 45:55.520
-Chayanee. -Miss Chayanee.

616
46:00.760 --> 46:02.040
-Miss Chayanee. -Dear.

617
46:07.000 --> 46:08.280
Miss Chayanee.

618
46:08.360 --> 46:09.800
Chayanee.

619
46:10.320 --> 46:12.680
-Chayanee. -Help my daughter.

620
46:12.760 --> 46:14.640
-Chayanee. -Chayanee.

621
46:15.760 --> 46:16.600
Chayanee.

622
46:30.800 --> 46:31.840
Let me.

623
46:50.080 --> 46:51.480
Boys…

624
46:52.240 --> 46:54.320
can cry too, right?

625
46:58.320 --> 47:00.480
You were really shocked

626
47:01.320 --> 47:02.640
when you found out, huh?

627
47:06.400 --> 47:11.280
I already knew Daddy Ramil wasn't my real father.

628
47:12.520 --> 47:14.160
That cuckoo lullaby.

629
47:14.240 --> 47:18.160
It makes me think of Papang and me.

630
47:18.760 --> 47:20.640
I agreed to be Papang's father.

631
47:21.520 --> 47:22.840
I've raised him for so long

632
47:23.720 --> 47:25.080
that I truly feel

633
47:25.720 --> 47:27.640
like I'm his real father.

634
47:52.600 --> 47:55.760
Papang, don't cry.

635
47:57.560 --> 47:59.000
It's okay. Calm down.

636
48:00.160 --> 48:03.200
No matter what happens, Daddy will never leave you.

637
48:03.280 --> 48:06.560
You are my son, no matter what.

638
48:07.640 --> 48:10.240
But I'm not really your son.

639
48:12.120 --> 48:16.560
Who told you? I may not be your biological father,

640
48:16.640 --> 48:19.800
but I raised you. I love you.

641
48:19.880 --> 48:23.160
No matter what happens, you are my son.

642
48:26.080 --> 48:28.560
And do you know how lucky you are?

643
48:29.200 --> 48:33.480
You have both Daddy Raiwin and Daddy Ramil.

644
48:42.120 --> 48:45.680
But will Uncle Raiwin still love me?

645
48:47.200 --> 48:50.600
Of course. Raiwin may have had reasons

646
48:50.680 --> 48:53.200
he couldn't tell anyone.

647
48:53.280 --> 48:57.440
That's why he asked me to take care of you first.

648
48:59.400 --> 49:01.240
Okay? Don't cry.

649
49:05.400 --> 49:07.200
I've been doing wrong for far too long.

650
49:08.320 --> 49:10.720
I'm going to make things right.

651
49:16.000 --> 49:18.680
The police called and said Pong is getting better.

652
49:18.760 --> 49:19.840
They're questioning him today.

653
49:19.920 --> 49:21.920
Then we'll finally find out what happened.

654
49:26.520 --> 49:27.600
What happened?

655
49:30.960 --> 49:31.880
Come in.

656
49:35.680 --> 49:37.000
Pong escaped.

657
49:37.960 --> 49:39.520
How did he get out?

658
50:00.960 --> 50:02.440
You're going to pay for this, Liu.

659
50:05.840 --> 50:07.120
I'm choosing to trust you.

660
50:07.840 --> 50:11.040
I believe you must have a good reason for wanting me to help my mom.

661
50:11.120 --> 50:12.880
I want you to be happy again.

662
50:12.960 --> 50:14.760
NEXT EPISODE

663
50:14.840 --> 50:17.560
But if you really love me, you have to do this for me.

664
50:17.640 --> 50:21.320
Are you going to save her life or save your own?

665
50:21.400 --> 50:24.000
I'll call someone to come collect your body myself.

666
50:24.080 --> 50:25.080
I have to kill him. If I don't,

667
50:25.160 --> 50:26.680
he'll drag me straight to prison.

668
50:26.760 --> 50:27.600
Die.

669
50:27.680 --> 50:29.360
I'm your son.

670
52:21.480 --> 52:25.640
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
